es the Great better known?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Charlemagne united much of western and central Europe, and his reign helped foster the Carolingian Renaissance.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7f6f-9ec7-10241770435c","description":"Charlemagne","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-70b0-94a5-e4621c4b7d9e","description":"Charles the Bald","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-72e9-8051-0415712f0350","description":"Charlione","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-72f8-92e2-8ad2a0cb8fc5","description":"Charity Charles","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-792b-b7e7-390615c14821","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"What explorer landed in China and reached Kublai Khan\'s court in 1275?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Marco Polo\'s travels, reaching Kublai Khan\'s court around 1275, were recorded in The Travels of Marco Polo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7433-b9f8-319c5adbabda","description":"Marco Polo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-72ff-8552-220da5e9eb31","description":"Christopher Columbus","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7960-ab11-babaeddcd938","description":"Ferdinand Magellan","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7591-8055-a1388ea77ea4","description":"Francis Drake","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7bdb-8bd1-5c17887cafc1","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"When was the first black US President elected?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Barack Obama won the 2008 election and took office in January 2009.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7789-af79-2fae73503c67","description":"2008","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-79bc-a215-3af6e0f0bac6","description":"2000","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-72ae-a974-6fdbc4e22828","description":"2004","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-73d0-b1ce-71466885fc76","description":"2012","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01