ong for the 1944 film musical Meet Me in St. Louis.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7cee-8299-cd82253e1dea","description":"Troubles","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7f1b-808f-04e24b6a5330","description":"Difficulties","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7a9c-9f0a-75016a9c5d38","description":"Woes","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-797f-beb3-42d132261c9b","description":"Sorrows","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7a66-ab34-ccf7a4c415ce","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"What was the nationality of Rasputin?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Rasputin was born in Siberia, then part of the Russian Empire, and became a confidant of Tsar Nicholas II\'s family.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-74c0-bd66-78d2f0010b59","description":"Russian","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-784f-94ea-4aa5ed6f5240","description":"Indian","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7d87-8a57-b7751e5730cc","description":"French","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-771e-9bbf-f25b9b84ab31","description":"Egyptian","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7a73-b641-bdd2dfd44838","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Which ancient city\'s most famous facade is carved into a cliff and known as the Treasury?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Petra\u2019s Treasury was likely built as a royal tomb; its name comes from a legend that treasure was hidden in the urn above its entrance.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-74ec-a1d3-ea0c5b8c4071","description":"Petra","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7f07-aa74-d60a460688a6","description":"Palmyra","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7750-a35e-58919e396208","description":"Persepolis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-7319-88fa-7f9c8aa8facd","description":"Ephesus","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-36f3-78c2-ac71-520395a74081","locale":"en-US","category":"01a2